The false-postcondition gate passed exactly as required: the off-by-one spec parsed successfully under `--dry-run`, then the real proof exited `1` with `WarnStuckClaimState` on `kadaneSmallest(T,H,H) + 1 = kadaneSmallest(T,H,H)`. This confirms the returned value is genuinely constrained.

